---
description: Keep passwords and tokens out of git, logs, and Allure
alwaysApply: true
---

# Credentials and reports

- Do not commit private secrets. `src/test/resources/config/env/qa.properties` may contain Restful Booker's published demo `admin` / `password123` only.
- Override a secret with `-Dauth.password=` or `AUTH_PASSWORD`. Do not add a dotenv loader.
- Mask logs and attachments with `com.ashishqa.api.logging.SensitiveDataRedactor`. Allure HTTP attachments go through `com.ashishqa.api.reporting.RedactingAllureFilter`, not a raw `AllureRestAssured` filter.
- Never log or attach a raw `Cookie`, `Authorization`, `password`, or `token`.
- Keep the per-test id from `com.ashishqa.api.logging.CorrelationId` on new request logging.
